The time is four o'clock now.
I am in the office.
I sit at my desk.
I type code.
Suddenly, it gets dark in the office.
I look outside through the window.
The sun is not in the sky.
It is not sunny outside now.
There are black clouds over Kochi city.
Prakash comes near my desk.
Prakash also looks through the window.
Prakash says, 'Maya, it will rain heavily.'
I say, 'Yes, the sky is black.'
It is very hot today.
But a good wind is blowing outside now.
It is not hot at all now.
We stand near the window.
We look at the black clouds.
